basic-pitch (vendored model files)
==================================

The two files in this directory —

  model.json
  group1-shard1of1.bin

— are the TensorFlow.js graph model published by Spotify's basic-pitch project.
They are redistributed here unchanged so this app can load them same-origin
(no CORS, no third-party CDN dependency, cacheable by a Service Worker).

Upstream: https://github.com/spotify/basic-pitch-ts (path: /model/)
          https://github.com/spotify/basic-pitch  (Python + reference weights)

License (code):     Apache License, Version 2.0
License (weights):  Creative Commons Attribution 4.0 International (CC BY 4.0)

  © Spotify AB, licensors of the basic-pitch model.

Attribution: this app uses Spotify's basic-pitch model for per-voice note
transcription. See docs/ML-NOTES.md for how it is wired in.

Nothing in this app modifies the model; it is loaded verbatim by TensorFlow.js
via the tf.io graph-model loader at runtime.
